---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title="Now"
			description="What I'm up to these days — work, side projects, and life outside of code."
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Now</h1>
			<p class="updated">Last updated: April 2026</p>

			<h2>Work</h2>
			<p>
				I'm a senior software engineer at <a href="https://pledge.to/" target="_blank">Pledge</a>,
				a fundraising platform for charity. I recently wrapped up an overhaul of the
				payment and billing systems and have now moved on to building a new
				donation form.
			</p>

			<h2>Side projects</h2>
			<p>
				Rebuilding this website in Astro, using it as a bit of a playground to try
				out new tools along the way.
			</p>

			<h2>Outside of code</h2>
			<p>
				I try to cook for myself as much as I can. Vietnamese and Mexican are my
				current favorite cuisines, and soup is where I like to let Mexican and
				Slavic cooking collide. I also like hiking, but I currently
				live far from the mountains, something I'm hoping to change before too
				long.
			</p>

			<h2>Reading, learning, listening</h2>
			<p>
				Currently reading the <em>Hávamál</em>. Learning about fascia and a few
				other health topics. On heavy rotation these days: Winona Oak, DJ Goja,
				and Malte Marten.
			</p>

			<p class="footnote">
				This is a <a href="https://nownownow.com/about" target="_blank">/now page</a>
				— a snapshot of what I'm currently focused on, updated every so often.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	main {
		width: calc(100% - 2em);
		max-width: 720px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2em 0;
	}
	h1 {
		margin-top: 0;
		margin-bottom: 0.25em;
	}
	.updated {
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		margin: 0 0 2em;
	}
	h2 {
		margin-top: 2em;
		margin-bottom: 0.5em;
	}
	p {
		color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
	}
	.footnote {
		margin-top: 3em;
		padding-top: 1em;
		border-top: 2px solid var(--border);
		font-size: 0.9em;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
	}
</style>
